# POSIX-first repo: keep line endings LF in the working tree too.
#
# Without this, a Windows checkout under core.autocrlf=true rewrites text files as
# CRLF, which changes their bytes: content digests pinned in tests stop matching and
# assertions that quote a multi-line fragment stop finding it. On POSIX nothing
# changes -- the files are already LF.
* text=auto eol=lf
